No law text is published. This repository holds metadata only.

Catalogue entries (bill number, title, Royal Assent date, chapter number) are facts recorded by the
Legislative Assembly of British Columbia (https://www.leg.bc.ca). Source: Legislative Assembly of British
Columbia. No text of its documents is reproduced, and nothing here is presented as an official version.

The "legal-system" facts come from Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org), released under CC0 1.0.

The statutes of British Columbia are published by the King's Printer on BC Laws
(https://www.bclaws.gov.bc.ca). They are not copied here.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
